<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33024" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκτοθεν</span></b> , Adv., (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκτός</span>) 
			Ep.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔξωθεν,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκτοσθεν</span>
			, <i>from without, outside</i>, c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ἄλλων μνηστήρων</span>
			<i>outside</i> their circle, <i>apart from</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.132
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίμνας ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				871
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πύργων δ᾽ ἔ.
			βαλών</span> having struck them <i>from</i> the wall, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				629
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. ἐρώτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.301.7
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs.,
				<i>outside, without</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδ᾽ ἀπ᾽
				ἄλλων ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ch.</u>
				473
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. βοᾶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					802
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. γαμεῖν</span> marry <i>from
				an alien house</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Andr.</u>
				975
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἔ</span>. things
			<i>abroad</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				10.9
			</span></i>:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκτοθεν αὐλῆς</span>
			is dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.239
			</span></i> (perh. <i>outside</i> in the court). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>without, unaccompanied by</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					11.428
				</span></i>
			.</div>
